                                "sense_id": "b62ba2c4-cae7-3746-93e0-f70a092b9d2a",
                                "text": "You must be picking up olfactory emanations from a subverse destined to be your neighbor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e4dba21-fb6f-43fa-8110-a0c9ef8a21c9",
                                "sense_id": "b62ba2c4-cae7-3746-93e0-f70a092b9d2a",
                                "text": "They had taken on a subverse being and come out on top, and although they did not name what had killed them, it must have been a cosmic being of supreme power."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
